content_en:
1 First buy robot stocks;
2 Prepare to escape to Mars.
😅😊😂

It might be insensitive to say this, but what are they even trying to do...?;
If it's just running in a straight line, it doesn't really need to be humanoid, does it...?;
It feels like they're spending money out of their way just to build a high-performance old-man robot;
I don't think it's amazing at all;
Far from it, it feels like the potential of physical AI is still in the distant future, though...;
Even if it amounts to something to a certain extent, it's probably gonna cost money for maintenance, system updates, breakdowns, and stuff anyway;
It needs energy too, and in no time the next latest model will come out, right?;
It stimulates my inner middle schooler, but maybe it'd be better to spend money on education and raise talented people...;
Lie! It's a lie! Please forget it! Awesome! It's so awesome! AI! We totally don't need it! Ah, my bad! I want it! I waaaant it! Hang in there, AI! You're so cool!!
